WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:06.381
My name is Leanne Grayson,
and I come from Wisconsin.

00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:11.011
I hope that you will consider me...

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.554
Do you have him?

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:13.055
Who?

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:19.520
...as a responsible and moral
guardian for your son.

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:21.563
They've taken Jericho.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.985
Leanne Grayson has been missing

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.028
for five days.

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:31.406
Leanne, if you're watching,

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:33.367
please come home.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:37.496
Why are you looking
so hard for this baby?

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:39.623
We were giving him a loving home.

00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.542
He was never yours to keep.

00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:43.752
If we can find Leanne,

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:45.629
she will lead us to Jericho.

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:47.714
She's not the sweet child
you think she is.

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:51.134
Why haven't you told her
what she did?

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:54.513
A camera?!

00:00:55.097 --> 00:00:56.473
We have to protect ourselves.

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.725
They have infiltrated our home.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:00.769
What did they want with us?

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:02.980
You have to understand,
for Jericho,

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.398
there is nothing I wouldn't do.

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:04.940
Nothing!

00:01:05.566 --> 00:01:06.984
We're hanging on by a thread.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.404
Her presence is an infection,

00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:12.489
and it's spreading.

00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:15.492
I want to see her get
what she deserves.

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:18.287
We are running out of time.

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:20.372
You'd die to be with him?

00:01:21.498 --> 00:01:22.332
I'm his mother.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.294
I don't know why
I keep doing bad things.

00:01:25.377 --> 00:01:26.128
Dorothy!

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:28.755
I can feel the dark thing
in me getting bigger.

00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:29.882
This is too far.

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:32.676
Nothing is too far.

00:01:34.595 --> 00:01:35.888
I hope that you will consider me...

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:39.516
...as a responsible and moral
guardian for your son.

